# Rust build output of the orchestrator daemon.

# Local orchd state under .sushiai/ stays out of git; the committed worktree
# setup (.sushiai/setup.json) is the one exception. Task worktrees live under
# the sushiAI home, outside the repo.
/.sushiai/*
!/.sushiai/setup.json

/target/

